    "_about": "Fair raids. Each home has a raid window the owner picks (windowHours long, starting at startHour, county time). While anyone on the home's crew is online (or was within offlineAfterMs), the base can be attacked at full strength at any hour: they can defend it. Once the whole crew is offline: outside the window the base is sealed (no damage, no lock bypass); inside the window it takes offlineMul of the damage. A new window takes effect changeDelayMs after you set it. A raid can carry off only takeShare of what a stash holds (takeShareOnline if someone was home), counted once per takeResetMs.",
